Notation: L = L_N[1/2, 1] = exp((log N log log N)^{1/2}); L[1/2, c] = L^c. "L^{o(1)}" means exp(o((log N log log
N)^{1/2})) uniformly in N; fixed powers L^ε and N^{o(1)} are not L^{o(1)}. ϱ(x) = ϱ(x, B) = Ψ(x, B)/x.

